{"id":"politique","lemma":"politique","pos":"noun","rank":943,"glosses":["politics","policy"],"ipa":"/pɔ.li.tik/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f5/Fr-politique.ogg/Fr-politique.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"politiques"},"formAudio":{"politiques":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-politiques.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je déteste parler de politique.","en":"I hate talking about politics.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"to speak, talk"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"La situation politique a changé.","en":"The political situation has changed.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"changer"}]},{"text":"Es-tu impliqué dans la politique ?","en":"Are you involved in politics?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to implicate","l":"impliquer"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Êtes-vous pour ou contre cette politique ?","en":"Are you in favor of or against that policy?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Les politiques du gouvernement ont échoué lamentablement.","en":"The government's policies failed miserably.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"government"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to fail","l":"échouer"},{"g":"awfully"}]}]}